index 8a942de..539aa65 100644
--- a/SECURITY.md
+++ b/SECURITY.md
@@ -39,3 +39,7 @@ Get-FileHash .\Nightlink-Setup-<version>.exe -Algorithm SHA256
 ```
 
 The hash must match the `SHA256SUMS.txt` line and the SHA-256 listed in the release notes. Do not run a file whose hash differs.
+
+## Unreadable lock settings
+
+If `security-settings.bin` exists but Windows protection cannot decrypt it, or its contents are not valid, the startup lock stays locked and offers **Reset lock settings…**. Reset requires typing `RESET`. It turns the lock off and removes the password, authenticator setup and recovery codes. Messages, contacts, channels and backups are not affected because the lock never encrypted them. The unreadable file is renamed to `security-settings.bin.<time>.unreadable` and kept; nothing is deleted. Reset is never offered when the settings are readable (including after a wrong password) or when Windows credential protection is unavailable; in that case restart Windows or sign in again and reopen Nightlink. There is no plaintext fallback. Each reset is logged by the main process with the backup file name. Tracked in [#87](https://github.com/njsnowman/nightlink/issues/87).
diff --git a/USER_GUIDE.md b/USER_GUIDE.md
index ac6909f..d2a4751 100644
--- a/USER_GUIDE.md
+++ b/USER_GUIDE.md
@@ -645,6 +645,14 @@ Set up a password and authenticator without mistaking it for history encryption.
 
 Use your password plus a fresh authenticator code, or a permitted one-time recovery code. Previously used authenticator codes can be rejected. Keep the PC clock accurate. Recovery codes do not remove the need for the password.
 
+### If the startup lock cannot open its settings
+
+1. The lock screen shows that protected security settings could not be opened.
+2. If **Reset lock settings…** is shown, select it, read the consequences, type RESET and select **Reset lock settings**.
+3. Nightlink opens with the lock off. Set up the lock again in Settings > Security if you want it.
+
+Messages, contacts, channels and backups are not changed. The unreadable file is kept beside the new settings. If the screen says Windows credential protection is unavailable, restart Windows or sign in again instead; reset is not offered.
+
 ### What the lock protects
 
 The startup lock controls entry to Nightlink. It is not full-disk encryption and does not make message databases or exported backups encrypted. MeshCore radio encryption and shared/private identities are separate from this local startup feature.
